@begin(section)

@title(API Reference)

This page documents the exported API of the zick system: every public
function and record of its five packages.  The packages mirror the
source files:

@begin(list)
@item(@c(com.djhaskin.zick) — the CLI entry point and the subcommand
implementations.)
@item(@c(com.djhaskin.zick/db) — the store: FSet persistent records
serialized as a single NRDL document.)
@item(@c(com.djhaskin.zick/fs) — filesystem and archive helpers: zip
reading, checksums, downloads, unpacking, and the marking-file search.)
@item(@c(com.djhaskin.zick/package) — package install, removal, upgrade,
and verification.)
@item(@c(com.djhaskin.zick/session) — database sessions and the zick
lock file.)
@end(list)

Each section below is generated from the source docstrings, so it stays
in sync with the code.

@begin(section)
@title(@c(com.djhaskin.zick))

The main package.  Its only export is @c(main), the entry point of the
CLI tool.

@cl:with-package[name="com.djhaskin.zick"](
@begin(section)
@title(@c(main))
@cl:doc(function main)
@end(section)
)
@end(section)

@begin(section)
@title(@c(com.djhaskin.zick/db))

The store: package records keyed by name and file records keyed by
path, persisted as one NRDL document in the @c(.zick-db) directory.

